      "value": "<p>Your foe takes all the fun out of your life by ramming his weapon into your gut, slicing up your intestines and spilling fecal matter into your abdominal cavity.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Prone]. Also, you contract @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.M8XyRs9DN12XsFTQ]{Blood Rot.} You can’t recover 2 of your lost Wounds until you’ve had Surgery.</p>"
